From 01a53234db5d185a039ed70baee665a7b824ed0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:39:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Kolvethis trick weapons to the Equipment page

Adds 53 homebrew trick weapons as a new Kolvethis source: both forms with
damage and properties, the Swap Strike, cost and consumables, house and
build axis. Adds a Kolvethis source chip, a badge on each row, search over
house, axis and Swap Strike text, and a rules note under the list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BvDjnd1PFYUgVaFT93aEBD
